{
  "info": {
    "name": "Transaction Service — Complete",
    "description": "Full test coverage for Transaction Service.\nGroup 5 — Siva Chokkalingam S (2024TM93515)\n\n## Quick Start\n1. Import this collection\n2. Set base_url = http://localhost:3003\n3. Run folders in order: Observability → Deposit → Withdraw → Transfer → Edge Cases",
